     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Local data frames are not deployed to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360501423000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XIw4a_nNeSlsG5Gov0-rK\">shinyapps.io</a>, so you need to ensure that your application loads the data it requires from something that is bundled with the code that is deployed.<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/229848967-Why-does-my-app-work-locally-but-not-on-shinyapps-io-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/229848967-Why-does-my-app-work-locally-but-not-on-shinyapps-io-&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360501423000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BV7ax21Rk9NHMzOoLlLch\">https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/229848967-Why-does-my-app-work-locally-but-not-on-shinyapps-io-</a></div></div>"
